&lt;div class=&quot;top-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;right-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;left-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bottom-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;SCP-5819 is to be kept inside an iron locker at Site-19. No further procedures are necessary.&lt;/span&gt; SCP-5819-A is to be kept in the same iron locker SCP-5819 was before Incident-5819. &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;SCP-5819-B is to be kept in SCP-914’s containment area as a temporary containment cell until further notice.&lt;/span&gt; SCP-5819-B is to be kept inside of Provisional Site-5819 for reasearch. SCP-5819-C doesn’t exist, so it doesn’t need to be, and can’t be, contained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;SCP-5819 is a gold amulet, with a ruby&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-740352-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; in the middle. When wearing SCP-5819, humans and gorillas begin to shrink until they’re so small, they’re invisible to the naked eye. When any other animal wears SCP-5819, they will grow until they either grow so big the ground beneath them can’t handle it’s mass and collapses or they die. SCP-5819 is observed to change size along with the subject until taken off. When SCP-5819 is took off a subject, the effect still remains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5819-A is the amulet itself. When held in a subject’s hand&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-740352-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, SCP-5819-A begins to shake vigorously. When took out of the subject’s hand, the effect remains for approximately a week. SCP-5819-B is the chain that let a subject wear SCP-5819 around their neck. When placed around the neck of a subject, the same effect as the former SCP-5819 occurs. SCP-5819-3 was the ruby in SCP-5819, see Incident-5819.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident-XXXX:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;21:00 | 1st December, 2003&lt;br /&gt;
The GOC broke into The Foundation. Tried to terminate a couple of SCPs. You know the drill.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;22:00 | 1st December, 2003&lt;br /&gt;
I think one of ‘em saw SCP-5819. He said some things that I don’t remember exactly what he said. Something saying they found an SCP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;23:00 | 1st December, 2003&lt;br /&gt;
Two more of the GOC came. Don’t think any of ‘em saw me. If they did, they’d probably shot me by then. It’s pretty obvious they never, innit?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;00:00 | 2nd December, 2003&lt;br /&gt;
Them idiots took SCP-5819! What are they, thieves? Anyways, I followed ‘em and guess what, they threw it! It shattered and, and.. boy, what ‘append after that? Well, I looked away for a second, someone shouted my name. Looked back, the GOC were gone! The Ruby in SCP-5819 was gone too! Don’t think we’ll be findin’ it any time soon though.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7141604&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608584918&quot; alt=&quot;TheKidNamedCover&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7141604)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover&quot;  &gt;TheKidNamedCover&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-740352-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;SCP-5819-1&lt;/span&gt; SCP-5819-C&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-740352-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. or in subjects that don’t have hands, wether they used to have one or not, touching it&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
